      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAX STAPPEN (7) was below best at his last start when 6th at this track following a third place finish (22.97) at Maitland two back. Has a good record here at this journey. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. SHORTY BOY (2) had the drop on the lead and went on to be beaten 6 lengths into third (25.50) at Grafton in a NG over 450m. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. RATTLIN' BYE (1) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with four wins and a placing from nine tries. In the money last time at Taree Super Track (17.51) in a Mix 1/2/3, finishing a 6 length second. Looks well placed here and among the chances. POCKET POINT (6) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
